<title>USA: USDA amends supplier credit guarantees to Mexico.</title>
<headline>USDA amends supplier credit guarantees to Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday amended the maximum terms of coverage for credit guarantees to Mexico under the Supplier Credit Guarantee program for fiscal year 1997 to 180 days from 90 days.</p>
</text>
